---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import TrustBand from '../../components/TrustBand.astro';

const title = 'Growth-Hormone Peptide Rx — My4MLife';
const description = 'Telemedicine consult to evaluate your candidacy for a growth-hormone releasing peptide — tesamorelin or CJC-1295.';
const canonical = 'https://www.my4mlife.com/rx/gh-peptide';

const rxSteps = [
  {
    title: 'Complete the health questionnaire',
    body: 'Five minutes, from your phone. No appointment, no waiting room.',
  },
  {
    title: 'A physician reviews',
    body: 'A licensed provider evaluates your history and goals.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Delivered to your door',
    body: 'Your protocol ships directly. Ongoing support included.',
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>

<section class="rx-section rx-section--top">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-eyebrow">Growth-Hormone Peptide Rx</p>
    <h1>The peptide that goes hand in hand with GLP-1 — losing the belly fat, keeping the muscle.</h1>
    <figure class="scene-figure">
      <img src="/images/scenes/muscle-active.jpg" alt="A person rowing a single scull across a calm lake at sunrise, mist rising off the water" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>The scale only tells you what left. This is about what stays — the strength you keep using it for.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<TrustBand />

<section class="rx-section rx-section--bottom">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-lead">
      Growth-hormone releasing peptides — tesamorelin or CJC-1295, the physician selects which fits your profile and goals — work on a different lever than a GLP-1. Instead of suppressing appetite, they stimulate your own pituitary gland to release growth hormone in its natural pulsing pattern. That pulse is clinically studied for reducing visceral and truncal fat and for preserving lean muscle mass — precisely the gap GLP-1 medications leave open: weight loss that takes muscle with it.
    </p>

    <p class="rx-body">
      Your telemedicine consult covers candidacy for both peptides. The physician reviews your history, your current GLP-1 use if any, and your goals, then determines which one fits and writes accordingly. This program is built to run alongside your GLP-1 protocol, not compete with it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<HowItWorks steps={rxSteps} />

<section class="rx-section rx-section--bottom">
  <div class="container rx-inner">
    <p class="rx-price-line">
      <strong>Free</strong> — telemedicine consult with a physician in our network. No lab work required.
      <span class="rx-pay-note">Medication is billed separately after the physician writes your script.</span>
    </p>

    <a class="rx-cta-btn" href="/rx/gh-peptide/questionnaire">
      Start Your Health Questionnaire &rarr;
    </a>

    <p class="rx-disclosure">
      6 quick steps. Your card will be saved securely — no charge until a physician reviews and approves your script. If you're not approved, your card is never charged.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.rx-section { padding: calc(76px + 3.5rem) 1rem 5rem; min-height: 60vh; }
.rx-section--top { padding-bottom: 1.5rem; min-height: 0; }
.rx-section--bottom { padding-top: 1.5rem; min-height: 0; }
.rx-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 1.25rem; }
.rx-eyebrow { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
.rx-inner h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--primary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.18; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.62; margin: 0; max-width: 640px; }
.rx-price-line { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--primary); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.55; }
.rx-price-line strong { color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.35rem; }
.rx-pay-note { display: block; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.35rem; }
.rx-cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,184,148,0.25); transition: opacity .15s; }
.rx-cta-btn:hover { opacity: 0.92; }
.rx-disclosure { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
